  "把心理测评，安静地留在自己手机里": "Keep psychological assessment quietly on your own phone",
  "「悦泽量表」是一款覆盖婴幼儿、学龄前、儿童、青少年、成人与老年全年龄阶段的 心理量表测评工具。完全离线运行、本地加密保存、无需注册登录，支持多测评对象建档、 结果历史与重测，并可一键导出 PDF 报告便于打印与就医沟通。": "YozerPsychoMetric is a psychological scale assessment tool covering all age stages from infants to the elderly. Fully offline, locally encrypted, with no registration or login, multi-person profiles, result history and re-testing, plus one-tap PDF export for printing and clinical communication.",
