  "内置题库以本地只读数据库形式随应用安装，打开即可使用，不依赖任何服务器。所有作答与结果均加密保存在本机。": "The built-in question bank is installed as a local read-only database and works immediately with no server dependency. All responses and results are encrypted on your device.",
